		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c09r0301_bigfour3_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さすが　だな！▼
ほかの　してんのう　とも　たたかい
さらなる　たかみを　めざせ……！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>流石だな！▼
他の　四天王とも　戦い
さらなる　高みを　めざせ……！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：クリア前
・戦闘後：フィールド</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>四天王：格闘
レンブ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T08:19:40" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c09r0301_bigfour3_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>つよき　ちょうせんしゃ　よ▼
じぶんが　しんじた　ポケモンと
じぶんの　しんじる　みちを　ゆけ！▼
ほかの　してんのうは
はるかに　てごわい……▽
ゆめゆめ　あなどるなよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-28T07:46:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>強き　挑戦者よ▼
自分が　信じた　ポケモンと
自分の　信じる　道を　ゆけ！▼
他の　四天王は
はるかに　手強い……▽
ゆめゆめ　あなどるなよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-28T07:47:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：クリア前
・bigfour3_02表示後に再度会話
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-28T07:41:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>四天王：格闘
レンブ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T08:19:40" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
